=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Brugaire (A)} at (L-6), northeast of Conflux #8, to begin the quest.
** You will be given a {@i:Prismatic Elixir|5445} {i:Prismatic Elixir|Prismatic Elixir|5445}.
